silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_08_cross_paper_bridges_sections_05_bridge_to_presheaf_semantics_concrete_anchor_3 silm:hasExample "In 'ConcreteAnchor — 05_bridge_to_presheaf_semantics #3', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, In section 'Bridge to Presheaf Semantics Paper' the bare symbol Hom(-,X) anchors to VetRecordAboutMittens: The vet-record file Dr. Osei filled out during Mittens' 2024-03-15 check-up: a physical document carrying body mass (4.2 kg), age, and clinical notes — the raw packet before any Forge handling.." .
